				 <i><span class="en">
					Thphr.
					<u>CP</u>
					4.7.3
				</span></i>
			 (
				Comp.
			); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔρια</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Gal.
					18(2).525
				</span></i>
			; of food, <i>easy of digestion</i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Mem.</u>
				4.3.6
			</span></i> (
				Comp.
			), <i><span class="en">
				Diph.Siph.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
