				6.1.12
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>easy to subdue</i> or <i>conquer</i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.H.
				3.20
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πᾶσιν</span>”
